## Pehle Samjho: REST vs GraphQL — Ek Real Example

### REST API ka Problem (jo tum already jaante ho)

```
Postman mein tum ye karte ho:

GET /users/123          → User milta hai (name, email, phone, address, bio...)
GET /users/123/issues   → Uske issues milte hain (50 fields per issue)
GET /issues/456/comments → Comments milte hain

3 alag requests = 3 network calls
Aur zyada data aata hai jitna chahiye = OVER-FETCHING
Ya kam data aata hai = UNDER-FETCHING
```

### GraphQL ka Solution

```
Ek hi request mein exactly jo chahiye woh maango:

POST https://api.linear.app/graphql

{
  user(id: "123") {
    name          ← sirf ye chahiye
    email         ← aur ye
    assignedIssues {
      title        ← aur sirf title
    }
  }
}

1 request = exactly jo maanga woh mila, kuch extra nahi
```

