## GraphQL Ka Mental Model — Restaurant Analogy

```
REST API    = Fixed thali — jo mile woh khao, choose nahi kar sakte
GraphQL     = À la carte menu — exactly jo chahiye woh order karo

Schema      = Menu card — kya available hai uski list
Query       = Order dena — data maangna (READ)
Mutation    = Kitchen ko change karna — data banana/badalna/hatana (WRITE)
Resolver    = Chef — actually data fetch karta hai behind the scenes
Endpoint    = Ek hi counter — saari cheezein wahan se milti hain

REST mein:  /users, /issues, /comments — alag alag counters
GraphQL mein: /graphql — ek hi counter, alag order
```

