## Linear API — Exactly Kya Hai?

Linear ek **project management tool** hai (Jira jaisa, lekin better).  
Unka poora API GraphQL pe based hai.

```
Linear App mein hota hai:
  Teams      → Engineering, Design, Marketing
  Projects   → "Q2 Launch", "Mobile App v2"
  Issues     → Tasks/bugs (like Jira tickets)
  Comments   → Issue pe discussion
  Users      → Team members
  Labels     → "Bug", "Feature", "Security"
  States     → "Todo", "In Progress", "Done"
```

Tum Linear ka API use karke:
- Apna custom dashboard bana sako
- Slack bot bana sako jo issues create kare
- GitHub PR se automatically issue close ho
- Startup ke liye custom workflow automate karo

