## Ek Base Function — Sabka Baap

Ye ek function likhlo, baaki sab iske upar banta hai:

```javascript
// ye function ek baar likho, baar baar use karo
async function linearQuery(query, variables = {}) {
  const res = await fetch('https://api.linear.app/graphql', {
    method: 'POST',                          // GraphQL mein HAMESHA POST
    headers: {
      'Content-Type': 'application/json',
      'Authorization': process.env.LINEAR_API_KEY
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({ query, variables }) // query + variables ek saath bhejo
  });

  const { data, errors } = await res.json();

  if (errors) throw new Error(errors[0].message);
  return data;
}

// Ab bas is function ko call karo
const result = await linearQuery(`query { viewer { name email } }`);
console.log(result.viewer.name);  // "Hard Patel"
```

