## Postman Ki Zaroorat Hai Ya Nahi?

```
REST API testing ke liye Postman:
  GET /users, POST /issues — alag alag URLs
  Postman mein collections banao, save karo

GraphQL testing ke liye:
  Ek hi URL: https://api.linear.app/graphql
  Body mein alag queries

GraphQL ke liye BETTER tools:
  1. GraphiQL    → Browser mein IDE, autocomplete, schema explorer
  2. Insomnia    → Postman jaisa but GraphQL support better
  3. Altair      → Dedicated GraphQL client, free
  4. Apollo Sandbox → apollo.io/sandbox, best for Apollo APIs

Postman bhi GraphQL support karta hai ab:
  New Request → GraphQL tab → Query likhne ka editor
  To Postman ki zaroorat completely khatam nahi hoti

Simple answer:
  Personal scripts/learning → raw fetch() ya LinearClient SDK
  Team collaboration       → Postman ya Insomnia (GraphQL mode mein)
  Apollo projects          → Apollo Sandbox
```

