## Linear SDK — Ye Sab Automatically Karta Hai

Manually query likhne ke bajaye Linear ka official SDK use karo:

```javascript
import { LinearClient } from '@linear/sdk';

const linear = new LinearClient({
  apiKey: process.env.LINEAR_API_KEY
});

// Ye internally GraphQL query run karta hai — tumhe likhna nahi padta
const me = await linear.viewer;
const myIssues = await me.assignedIssues();
const firstIssue = myIssues.nodes[0];

// Issue update karo — mutation automatically hogi
await firstIssue.update({ stateId: "STATE-DONE-ID" });

// Comment add karo
await linear.createComment({
  issueId: firstIssue.id,
  body: "Ye fix ho gaya, PR #234 mein"
});

// Pagination — built-in helpers
const allIssues = await linear.issues({ first: 50 });
const nextPage = await allIssues.fetchNext();   // cursor automatically handle
```

