## Versioning — GraphQL mein Kaise Kaam Karta Hai?

```
REST mein versioning:
  /api/v1/users
  /api/v2/users   ← breaking change pe naya version
  Purani apps v1 use karti rahen

GraphQL mein versioning:
  URL same rehta hai — api.linear.app/graphql
  New fields add karo — purani queries todti nahi
  Old fields "@deprecated" mark karo
  Kabhi URL nahi badlata

Example:
  Old query: { user { name email } }          → still works
  New fields: { user { name email avatar } }  → naya field add hua
  Deprecated: { user { phone } }              → warning aata hai use karo toh
```

