## Job Mein Kya Kaam Aayega — Practical Skills

### Junior Developer ke liye (Tumhara Level)

```
1. GraphQL queries likhna — data fetch karna
   → useQuery with Apollo/TanStack
   → Variables use karna (dynamic queries)

2. Mutations likhna — data create/update
   → useMutation
   → onSuccess mein cache invalidate karna

3. Error handling
   → errors array check karna
   → Loading states handle karna

4. Pagination implement karna
   → Cursor-based pagination samajhna
   → "Load More" button banana

5. Linear SDK use karna
   → Team ke tools banana
   → Issue tracking automate karna
```

### Startup mein Ye Banao (Portfolio ke liye)

```
1. Team Dashboard
   → Linear se issues fetch karo
   → Priority + assignee ke hisaab se sort karo
   → React mein real-time updates (polling ya subscriptions)

2. Slack Bot
   → Slack command "/create-bug" → Linear mein issue banta hai
   → Node.js + Linear GraphQL mutation

3. GitHub Integration
   → PR merge hone pe Linear issue automatically "Done" ho jaaye
   → GitHub webhook → Linear mutation

4. Sprint Report Generator
   → Linear se sprint data fetch karo
   → PDF/email mein summary bhejo
   → Weekly automation
```

